ん","creatorId":"vndb:s22108","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22108","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22108","name":"松井 章","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220793","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"JORI","creatorId":"vndb:s39279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s39279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s39279","name":"JORI","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220795","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ROMA","creatorId":"vndb:s43647","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s43647","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s43647","name":"ROMA","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220796","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"三澄 クラゲ","creatorId":"vndb:s45930","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s45930","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s45930","name":"三澄 クラゲ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220797","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"まいじん","creatorId":"vndb:s45931","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s45931","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s45931","name":"まいじん","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220798","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"葵 いつき","creatorId":"vndb:s14206","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14206","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14206","name":"葵 樹","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220799","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"TOM","creatorId":"vndb:s55611","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s55611","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s55611","name":"TOM","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220800","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"チーム＋＋","creatorId":"vndb:s55613","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s55613","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s55613","name":"チーム＋＋","roleCode":"qa","roleLabel":"品质保证","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220802","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"チーム＋＋","creatorId":"vndb:s55613","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s55613","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s55613","name":"チーム＋＋","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:220803","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c87721","characterName":"カリン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["21864","28407"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87721"},"originalCharacterName":"カリン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Demon"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Role: Demon Queen"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Demon Queen who ruled the country and was sealed away 1,000 years ago by a \"hero\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite this, she seems to hold no ill will towards humanity. In fact, she seems to like them quite a bit, and is eager to hear their stories. During the time she ruled the area, she introduced many cultural and technological innovations from the Demon World, like the concept of insurance, and the game of Chess. She is fond of books and games, and is constantly asking Kazuto to buy her more."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her power is sealed by six Seal Stones that are buried throughout the mountain. At first, she appears as a phantom, barely able to interact with the world. As more of the stones are recovered, she regains her physical form, and eventually her full power. She doesn't want any lives to be lost for the sake of her revival, even if they see her as an enemy."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"While it is told that she was a tyrant who took over the country, the truth is that she was friends with the human queen who was the previous ruler. The queen willingly passed on the throne to Karin, who took it to help her friend. The human queen and her husband took on ordinary lives. However, their child was unsatisfied with such a life and felt that they deserved the throne that was their birthright. They sealed Karin away, and vilified her, leading them to be known as a \"hero\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87721"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"朽ちた迷宮の奥深く、封印されし魔王は思う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちゃんと『魔王復活保険』に加入していたのに、もう千年近く経ってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何か手違いがあったのだろうか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうでもいいから誰か復活させてくれないかしら。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怒りに震えるわけでもなく、現実を受け止める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それこそが魔王の器量、かどうか分からないが、魔王カリンは、ただその時を待っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"予感はあるのだ。きっ近々やってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間も魔族も隔てなく支配する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな心優しき独裁者が、一人の青年と出会った時。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこにはきっと素敵な迷宮があるのだろう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰もが病棟に楽しめるような、世界一の迷宮が。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21864","sourceWorkId":"28157","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"異世界の魔王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルトの夢の中に登場し、時に助言を与えてくれる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大切なものを取り戻すために、世界を越えて探索をしているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、この世界に目的のものはなく、普段は魔道具を使い、時々、魔塔を観察しているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あちらの世界も色々あるようで息抜きのようなものだろう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、相手は魔王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただの息抜きで終わるはずもなく……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心の塊である彼女と六人の選ばれし配下たちが、煉獄へと来る未来はそう遠くないのかもしれない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28407","sourceWorkId":"39953","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f9c10769ad1011352d92c97319a0c19c565393845bd2bf160e32d41286a719d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37572a512268e6b460278e333202b7773fb631036d12ac46fd53f5ab0ce83446.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"乃嶋 架菜","creatorId":"vndb:s790","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s790","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s790","name":"前田 ゆきえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLa